trition if  you're eating like this he said oh I  wonder why the hairs were falling out of  my legs so I said sit down I make you an  omelette  I made him honor well as they say way to  a man's heart is through his stomach  right so you married the house cleaner I  thought but of course as soon as he got  married is two different stories up at  the desk already all right can turn my  well working okay yes I think what what  he's left behind in what you have worked  on here is it's so special and I think  it's something that a lot of people want  to hear about and I just find it  interesting the it's just it's it's the  dedication and it's also just the  conviction to stay with something no  matter how complicated or difficult that  was like it just seems like he was on  [Music]  unbending right yes both of you I think  I think he he would have called it not  stubbornness so much or unbending but  wanting to do something unusual to do  something in a different way that will  shake up the genre it isn't where  biography

